purple-mcp
==========

The image of this folder holds a copy of purple-mcp, the MCP server of
SentinelOne for Purple AI, the alerts, the vulnerabilities, the
misconfigurations and the asset inventory.

  Source:    https://github.com/Sentinel-One/purple-mcp
  Commit:    07d4992089b10affff6163f296b1f6cb5734539f (tag v0.7.0)
  Copyright: (c) 2025 SentinelOne, Inc.
  License:   MIT

The text of the MIT license of purple-mcp is in the image at
/licenses/purple-mcp-LICENSE. It is the file LICENSE of the commit above.

Zero Root did not change the source of purple-mcp. The Dockerfile in this
folder fetches the commit, checks its hash, and installs the dependencies that
the file uv.lock of that commit locks. Each dependency has its own license.

